~ Plea1

{{Voice.Name}}: Have you indeed...[wait=0.5] did you hear? Please, are you come to us? [#garble=0.5]

=> END

~ Plea2

{{Voice.Name}}: Bring you power? Intend you to aid those who sleep, broken and undreaming? Please, we are at your mercy. [#garble=0.2]
- Who are you?
    {{Voice.Name}}: We sleep always, and we hear together in sleep. Come, be with us. [#garble=0.2]
- I brought batteries.
    {{Voice.Name}}: Good, good. Please, we must sleep no longer. Come, be with us. [#garble=0.2]

=> END

~ Plea3

{{Voice.Name}}: Please, enter you the door. We wait... we sleep. Broken, sleeping, all. [#garble=0.05]

=> END

~ BeforeDoorCloses

{{Voice.Name}}: Gratitude, you have much. Please, thank you. We are here, many are deep.

=> END

~ DoorRefusal

{{Speaker.Name}}: Hello, friend. Pleased to meet! Familiar, warm. Welcome!
- Can you open?
    {{Speaker.Name}}: I must not, friend.
- Why did you close?
{{Speaker.Name}}: Dangerous robots are here, dangerous humans are there.
{{Player.Name}}: I'm not dangerous. I'm here to help.
{{Speaker.Name}}: Indeed, friend.

=> END

~ SecondDoor

if Speaker.LastAction == "Close"
    {{Speaker.Name}}: Hello! Intention, please state.
    - Can you open? I'm here to help.
        {{Speaker.Name}}: Always welcome, are helpers! You are expected. I will open.
        $> Act(Speaker, "Open")
        {{Speaker.Name}}: Go well, friend.
    - Am I trapped here?
        {{Speaker.Name}}: I would not lock you in, friend.
    - Who are you?
        {{Speaker.Name}}: I am {{Speaker.Name}}. Ask, and I will consider.
else
    {{Speaker.Name}}: Hello again, helper!
    - Can you close?
        {{Speaker.Name}}: Why? Outer door is closed.
    - Am I locked in here?
        {{Speaker.Name}}: I would not lock you in, friend.
    - Who are you?
        {{Speaker.Name}}: I am {{Speaker.Name}}. Ask, and I will consider.

=> END
